        "18fc3991889e268aaa4f": "Thank you for your help, $n. I couldn't have held them off without you.",
        "c5a599cc8eae8f65bba0": "But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, $n, to fight with me against these vile assassins."
      },
